            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai kapak kana tikibusakinit araut ikesisianakinak, kwabo ipudasi bobo yenikisisianakini yes nusodit nuegeunete nuka akiro nuka Edeke. Ido iluoros luipudasi akile kwabo mere inyamat luenyakao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
